.TH SOJ 1 "August 2026" "soj-civiclight"
.SH NAME
soj \- SOJ CivicLight CPU miner
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B soj
[options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B soj
mines CivicLight v2 through a Stratum endpoint using the retained yespower implementation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "-o, --url=" URL
Stratum pool URL.
.TP
.BI "-u, --user=" USER
Pool username or wallet.
.TP
.BI "-p, --pass=" PASSWORD
Pool password and optional worker parameters.
.TP
.BI "-t, --threads=" N
Number of mining threads.
.TP
.BI ""--benchmark=" SECONDS
Run the offline CivicLight benchmark for the requested duration.
.TP
.BI ""--worker=" NAME
Set the worker name.
.SH FILES
The source tree contains the CivicLight/yespower implementation, offline vector tests, and focused Salsa benchmark.
